cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data files, please cite this repository and state the snapshot tag or the SYNC_STATUS.json last_sync you used."
title: "Crovia Evidence Lab: public data plane of the 2026 archive"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Crovia Trust"
    email: info@croviatrust.com
    website: https://croviatrust.com
repository-code: https://github.com/croviatrust/crovia-evidence-lab
url: https://croviatrust.com/registry/api/
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: 2026-09-19
keywords:
  - AI transparency
  - training data disclosure
  - open data
  - reproducible research
  - signed observations
abstract: >
  Hourly exports of the Crovia 2026 archive ledger (observations of what AI providers publish
  about training data, and the absence of it), registry snapshots with their Merkle roots,
  weekly leaderboards tagged snapshot-YYYY-Www, and the frozen 2026-H1 experiments (CEPT,
  CRC-1, DSSE, Spider) from which the registry grew. The repository is Apache-2.0; exported data files
  that carry a license field state their own terms (CC-BY-4.0), attribution "Crovia Trust, https://croviatrust.com". Live proofs of absence are
  published by TACET at croviatrust.com/registry/data/tacet/.
references:
